From 4edcfa696fbb8dc217de0e849048c29ae6ff7bcd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shreyash Damanwala <shreyash.damanwala@nxp.com>
Date: Mon, 10 Aug 2026 13:46:23 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] PCI: endpoint: Add iKVM HID input support to i.MX9 VGA EPF Driver

Extend the i.MX9 VGA PCIe endpoint function with iKVM HID input support over a shared BAR3 ring buffer.

* Increase the VGA VRAM BAR2 size to 64MB.
* Add a 32KB BAR3 HID ring buffer.
* Add the PCIe KVM HID helper and shared HID report structures.
* Support keyboard, relative mouse, and absolute mouse reports.
* Capture local keyboard HID reports and forward them to the host.
* Add character device interfaces for remote keyboard and mouse input.
* Load the iKVM-specific PCIe Option ROM when KVM input support is enabled.
* Export the HID BAR address from the i.MX9 VGA endpoint function.
* Add Kconfig and Makefile support for the new iKVM input driver.

Upstream-Status: Pending
Signed-off-by: Shreyash Damanwala <shreyash.damanwala@nxp.com>
